# digest-sealed — a new idea is a NEW file under a NEW name (§3.1).
#
# PREDICTION (write BEFORE assessing — the seal makes it non-retractable):
#   pipeline: RawPointCount should stay unchanged. VoxelizedPointYield should
#             increase with a smaller voxel. Smaller matching gates may reduce
#             RMSE or fitness without implying a better camera trajectory.
#   baseline: Hypothesis: finer geometry may improve Mean L2 relative to the
#             0.05 m reference (0.05883481 m), but noise and weak support may
#             instead make registration worse. Preserve every one of 191 frames.
#   treatment: voxel_size_m=0.03; registration_seed=0; icp_backend=open3d.
#              Normal radius=0.06 m; FPFH radius=0.15 m;
#              RANSAC/ICP distance gate=0.045 m.
# =============================================================================

